-- held-whole: the modules every piece of whose text, after the head, another module also holds. Such a
-- module adds no text to the source: it is a copy of part of the other. Identical modules are listed once
-- (the one whose path sorts later). Built on the same index same-text reads.
hy-hw-tail : List (List Word) → List (List Word)
hy-hw-tail nil = nil
hy-hw-tail (cons h r) = r
